This record describes one fruit. The features are available to the model; the label is the answer used during training.

```javascript
const fruit = {
  features: { color: "green", weightGrams: 150 },
  label: "pear"
};
console.log(fruit.features.weightGrams);
console.log(fruit.label);
```

It prints 150, then pear. Recording the data does not train a model.
